- Data deletion rules (right to erasure, account deletion)
- Audit logging rules (what events must be logged)
- Consent management rules
- Reporting obligations
- Geographic/jurisdictional rules

### 9. Operational Rules

| Rule ID | Rule Statement | Category | Trigger | Action | SLA |
|---------|---------------|----------|---------|--------|-----|
| OPR-001 | ... | Operations | ... | ... | ... |

Cover:
